  `art:seed_rho`, $129R/(V(U+129))$; `SeedOrbit.seedRatio` is its value at the root.
* $\mathcal B(H,g,g^+,\alpha)$ of `art:failure_update` is `SeedCycle.update H g g⁺ α`,
  literally `inverseBFGS H (bfgsStep H g α) (g⁺ - g)` with `bfgsStep H g α = -α • (H *ᵥ g)`
  (`update_def`). $g_0,g_1,g_2$ are `SeedCycle.g0`, `SeedCycle.g1`, `SeedCycle.g2 c d`,
  i.e. `![1,0]`, `![-1,-1/8]`, `![c,d]`, and $M_1$ is `SeedCycle.M1`.
* The rows of Table `art:trial_table` are `q : Fin 9` with phase `trialPhase q`, trial
