  The points $z_j$ of `art:seed_points` and the directions $p_j$ are
  `SeedOrbit.point c d ρ j` and `SeedOrbit.direction c d ρ j`; the query of a row is
  `SeedOrbit.trial c d ρ j α = z_j + α p_j`.
* `IntervalBounds.Bounds a x b` is `a ≤ x ∧ x ≤ b`: the interval $[a,b]$ encloses $x$.

